    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-03 Scoring & AI Review (action SCREEN_APPLICATION)\n1. Re-check state: it continues only if the application is still VALIDATED.\n2. Rule score: the backend reads the scoring rules from the DB (data-driven), then `api.record_application_score` moves it to SCORED.\n3. Advisory AI: an output that is validated, or a FALLBACK when AI is unavailable or malformed. Stored with `api.record_ai_analysis`.\n4. Decision policy: the rules decide, and AI can only add a human review. `api.apply_screening_decision` moves it to SHORTLISTED / SCREENING_REVIEW / REJECTED.\nRetryable failures return FAILED so the dispatcher retries with backoff. Permanent failures go to the error queue (replay WF-03).",
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "f27a8548-eaf3-4fd5-a7b7-72ed990d5cda",
